This repository is an independent Swift port of the TripoSR image-to-3D
model onto Apple's MLX. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Tripo AI,
Stability AI, Meta AI, or Apple.

Third-party software and models this package builds on:

1. TripoSR (Tripo AI & Stability AI / VAST-AI-Research)
   https://github.com/VAST-AI-Research/TripoSR
   https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/TripoSR
   MIT License, Copyright (c) 2024 Tripo AI & Stability AI.
   The upstream release states the MIT license includes the source code
   and the pretrained models. License text: LICENSES/TripoSR.txt.
   The Swift sources in this repository were copied from the TripoSR
   submodule of https://github.com/signalnotnoise/apple-mlx-foundations
   (submodule commit 6da4a3cd3f8454f7c98607249476a26c836509ee).

2. DINO ViT-B/16 image tokenizer (Meta AI)
   https://huggingface.co/facebook/dino-vitb16
   The TripoSR configuration initializes its image tokenizer from
   facebook/dino-vitb16. Those parameters ship inside the upstream TripoSR
   checkpoint and inside the converted file
   triposr_swift_ready.safetensors. They are not included in this
   repository.

3. MLX and mlx-swift (Apple)
   https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx
   https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx-swift
   MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023 Apple Inc.
   Used as a Swift package dependency. Not vendored.

Model weights:
No pretrained weights are included in this repository. The Swift loader
accepts triposr_swift_ready.safetensors published at
https://huggingface.co/signalNotNoise/triposr-mlx
(revision 76f3028746d0b5f39b6ba0205ede9e28835f106d when this package was
extracted). That file is a format and layout conversion of the upstream
checkpoint, not a separately trained model. Verify it with the checksum
in README.md before use.
